2/CH-3/CH-4/CH-5/CH-6/CH-7, All</title><table id="TABLE_29C98EC5-39D6-414B-B7A9-1A250F7F0D98_1"><title>LPDDR5/x CAMM x32 Type 3 WCK, CH-0/CH-1/CH-2/CH-3/CH-4/CH-5/CH-6/CH-7, All Routing Guidelines</title><tgroup cols="4"><thead><row><entry>Segment</entry><entry>Tline Type</entry><entry>Max Length Segment (mm)</entry><entry>Max Length Segment Note</entry></row></thead><tbody><row><entry><p>BO1</p></entry><entry><p>MS</p></entry><entry><p>3.9</p></entry><entry><p /></entry></row><row><entry><p>BO2</p></entry><entry><p>SL</p></entry><entry><p /></entry><entry><p>14 - BO1</p></entry></row><row><entry><p>M</p></entry><entry><p>SL</p></entry><entry><p /></entry><entry><p /></entry></row><row><entry><p>BI1</p></entry><entry><p>SL</p></entry><entry><p>32</p></entry><entry><p /></entry></row><row><entry><p>BI2</p></entry><entry><p>MS</p></entry><entry><p>1.7</p></entry><entry><p>This is the Tee BI2</p></entry></row></tbody></tgroup></table><p>Max Length Total (mm): 75</p><p>Max Length Total Note: Max length is package + motherboard.</p></section></body></topic>